# Cloudflare Tunnel (cloudflared)
#
# Setup:
# 1. In the Cloudflare dashboard create a remotely-managed tunnel:
#    Zero Trust -> Networks -> Tunnels -> Create a tunnel -> Cloudflared.
#    Copy the token shown at the end of the wizard.
# 2. On that tunnel, add two public hostnames (Public Hostname tab):
#      expenses.rpamplona.com      -> service: http://frontend:80
#      expenses-api.rpamplona.com  -> service: http://backend:8000
#    `frontend` and `backend` are the expenses compose service names, which
#    resolve only on the shared `cloudflared` network (isolated from the rest
#    of the homelab).
# 3. Copy this file to .env and paste the token:
#      cp .env.example .env
#
TUNNEL_TOKEN=change-me
